      "text": [
        ": «مَنْ كَثُرَ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّهْوُ فِي اَلصَّلاَةِ فَلْيَقُلْ إِذَا دَخَلَ اَلْخَلاَءَ: بِسْمِ اَللَّهِ وَ بِاللَّهِ أَعُوذُ بِاللَّهِ مِنَ اَلرِّجْسِ اَلنِّجْسِ اَلْخَبِيثِ اَلْمُخْبِثِ اَلشَّيْطَانِ اَلرَّجِيمِ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.42 - I found in the handwriting of Sa’d ibn Abdullah a narration attributed to Imam Al-Sadiq (as), in which He said:\n\"Whoever experiences frequent forgetfulness in prayer should say, upon entering the restroom:\nBismillāhi wa billāhi a‘ūdhu billāhi mina al-rijsi al-najsi al-khabīthi al-mukhbithi al-shayṭāni al-rajīm\n'In the name of Allah (swt) and by Allah (swt). I seek refuge in Allah (swt) from the unclean, impure, evil, defiling devil, the accursed.'\""
        ]
      }
    },
